     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#467886\" vlink=\"#96607D\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\">Hi everyone,<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\">We&#39;re seeking Carpentries-certified instructors for Bioconductor Carpentry workshops that will be held before the EuroBioC2025 conference in Barcelona, Spain in September. Ideally, you’ll be\r\n attending EuroBioC2025 (September 17th-19th), but that’s not mandatory. We will provide funds to cover 2 nights’ accommodation.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\">The Bioconductor Carpentry workshops we plan to run September 15th-16th are the\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><a href=\"https://carpentries-incubator.github.io/bioc-rnaseq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://carpentries-incubator.github.io/bioc-rnaseq/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246204352000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02vrpXAZM88x58w5C8FYS8\"><span style=\"color:#96607d\">RNA-Seq Analysis with Bioconductor</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"> and the new\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><a href=\"https://carpentries-incubator.github.io/bioc-scrnaseq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://carpentries-incubator.github.io/bioc-scrnaseq/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246204352000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0jM5cxRlaThhB-tejKkoTY\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Single-cell analysis with Bioconductor</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\">.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\">If you&#39;re available to teach,\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\">please let me know:</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<ol style=\"margin-top:0in\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#212121;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Which workshop you’d be interested in teaching<u></u><u></u></span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#212121;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">If you are able to self-fund your travel to/from Barcelona for the workshops.<u></u><u></u></span></li></ol>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"> </span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\">Deadline: Friday, March 7<sup>th</sup><u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\">If you need more time to figure out if you can, just let me know.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\">Thanks!</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\">Maria<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:white;border-collapse:collapse\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height:19.95pt\">\r\n<td width=\"454\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:340.2pt;padding:2.85pt 0in 2.85pt 0in;height:19.95pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#005335;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Maria Doyle, PhD</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#005335;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height:62.7pt\">\r\n<td width=\"454\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:340.2pt;padding:2.85pt 0in 2.85pt 0in;height:62.7pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#00b140;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Bioconductor Community Manager</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#005335;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">School of Medicine, </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#005335;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">University of Limerick, Limerick, V94 T9PX<br>\r\nIreland</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#005335;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Email: </span><span style=\"color:black\"><a href title=\"mailto:mar...@ul.ie\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#0563c1;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">maria...@ul.ie</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#005335;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Phone (office): <a href=\"tel:+353%2061%20234%20768\" value=\"+35361234768\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+353 61 234 768</a></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Connect with the Bioconductor community at our conferences:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black\"><a href=\"https://gbcc2025.org/\" title=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bioconductor_gbcc2025-bioconductor-galaxy-activity-7236739126190829569-QdEH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gbcc2025.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246204352000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3M5zr3yvHpfj_WNox1SJ96\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:blue;text-decoration:none\">GBCC\r\n 2025 (June 23-26, New York, USA)</span></a><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bioconductor_eurobioc2024-eurobioc2025-activity-7237888796564885505-hUW6\" title=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bioconductor_eurobioc2024-eurobioc2025-activity-7237888796564885505-hUW6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bioconductor_eurobioc2024-eurobioc2025-activity-7237888796564885505-hUW6&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246204352000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3cE0Q8-9Ii_uuFzb0jHX_r\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:blue;text-decoration:none\">EuroBioC\r\n 2025 (September 17-19, Barcelona, Spain)</span></a><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></li></ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in;background:white\"> </span></i></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in;background:white\">I work flexible hours across several time zones. I don&#39;t expect you to read or respond\r\n to my emails outside of your normal working hours.</span></i><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in;background:white\"> </span></i><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"47\" style=\"width:1.6666in;min-height:.4895in\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioconductor-teaching/attach/6d9070fa88ee/image001.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"wKkTIm24wiP8wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\"></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#212121\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"168\" height=\"50\"